non-empty array (for rerank).",[473,1033,1034,1037],{},[239,1035,1036],{},"model"," is present (any string).",[223,1039,1040,1041,1044,1045,1048,1049,1052,1053,409,1056,409,1059,1062,1063,1065,1066,1068],{},"The current client does ",[234,1042,1043],{},"not"," throw ",[239,1046,1047],{},"UnsupportedFeatureError"," for\n",[239,1050,1051],{},"n>1",", tools, ",[239,1054,1055],{},"tool_choice",[239,1057,1058],{},"response_format",[239,1060,1061],{},"logprobs",", image\ncontent, or audio content. Those features are forwarded to the Rust\nplugin (which handles them when the relevant feature is enabled) and\nthe TypeScript layer no longer rejects them. The\n",[239,1064,1047],{}," class is still exported from\n",[239,1067,996],{}," for adapter authors, but the Tauri client does not\nthrow it.",[247,1070,1072],{"id":1071},"streaming-cancellation","Streaming cancellation",[223,1074,1075,1076,1079,1080,1083,1084,1086,1087,966,1090,1093,1094,1097,1098,1101],{},"The Tauri streaming chunks carry a ",[239,1077,1078],{},"requestId",". To cancel a streaming\nrequest, call ",[239,1081,1082],{},"plugin:llama-crab|cancel"," with the same ",[239,1085,1078],{},". The\n",[239,1088,1089],{},"AsyncIterable\u003CChatCompletionChunk>",[239,1091,1092],{},"AsyncIterable\u003CCompletionChunk>","\nreturned by the client respects the ",[239,1095,1096],{},"AbortSignal"," passed through\n",[239,1099,1100],{},"CallOptions = { signal?: AbortSignal }"," and triggers the cancellation\nautomatically.",[1103,1104,1105],"style",{},"html pre.shiki code .sBMFI, html code.shiki .sBMFI{--shiki-light:#E2931D;--shiki-default:#FFCB6B;--shiki-dark:#FFCB6B}html pre.shiki code .sfazB, html code.shiki .sfazB{--shiki-light:#91B859;--shiki-default:#C3E88D;--shiki-dark:#C3E88D}html .light .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-light);background: var(--shiki-light-bg);font-style: var(--shiki-light-font-style);font-weight: var(--shiki-light-font-weight);text-decoration: var(--shiki-light-text-decoration);}html.light .shiki span 